" Tridactyl starter configuration.
" Requires the native messenger. Load with :source or press ,r.

" Follow the system's light/dark theme.
colors auto

" Use home-row letters for link hints (f / F).
set hintchars asdfghjkl

" Shift-j / Shift-k: previous / next tab.
bind J tabprev
bind K tabnext

" Reload this configuration after editing it.
bind ,r source

" Useful defaults: j/k scroll, H/L back/forward, o/t open URL or search,
" f/F follow a link in this tab/a background tab, d close tab, u reopen tab.
